   - reuse any part of the code or assets in another mod, game, program or project;
   - redistribute, re-upload, mirror, sell or rent the Overhaul or any modified
     version of it, or publish a fork of it outside GitHub's own fork feature;
   - remove or change this notice.

3. GitHub

   Publishing this repository on GitHub means GitHub's Terms of Service apply to it:
   GitHub users may view it and fork it on GitHub. That does not grant any right to
   use, modify or redistribute the code or assets beyond what this licence allows.

4. Balatro

   The Overhaul is an unofficial fan mod. Balatro, its name, logo, art, music and
   code belong to LocalThunk and Playstack. None of it is covered by this licence,
   and none of it is included here: the Overhaul is built from your own copy on your
   own device.

5. Third-party parts

   The parts made by others keep their own licences, whose full texts are in the
